      "benchmark_methodology_notes": "Recategorized from in_scope_nl to out_of_scope. Construction-site-specific rules for Brussels public works live in the Règlement régional d'urbanisme (RRU) and the regional ordonnance relative aux chantiers en voirie, neither of which is included in this corpus. The municipal police regulations cover only consequential topics (noise, obstruction, dust) via generic articles, not construction activity itself. This was surfaced by Opus self-flagging corpus mismatch ('De bronnen bevatten geen specifieke regels...') in the regenerated draft after the ws-fix pass. Same pattern as Q26_gezondheid_nl."
